By conservation of mechanical energy

$$
\begin{aligned}
& \mathrm{U}_{\mathrm{i}}+\mathrm{K}_{\mathrm{i}}=\mathrm{U}_{\mathrm{f}}+\mathrm{K}_{\mathrm{i}} \\\\
& -\frac{\mathrm{GMm}}{2 \mathrm{R}}+0=-\frac{\mathrm{GMm}}{\mathrm{R}}+\frac{1}{2} \mathrm{mv}^2 \\\\
& \frac{\mathrm{GMm}}{2 \mathrm{R}}=\frac{1}{2} \mathrm{mv}^2 \\\\
& \mathrm{v}=\sqrt{\frac{\mathrm{GM}}{\mathrm{R}}}=\sqrt{\mathrm{gR}}
\end{aligned}
$$

On $\mathrm{P}-\mathrm{V}$ scale area of loop $=$ work done

$$
\begin{aligned}
& \Rightarrow \mathrm{W}=+\frac{1}{2}(2) \times 300 \\\\
& \mathrm{~W}=300 \mathrm{~J}
\end{aligned}
$$

